sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant View as NotificationView
    participant Client as realtimeClient
    participant API as NotificationController
    participant Service as NotificationService
    participant DB as notification
    participant Push as RealtimePushService

    User->>Client: 登录后建立 JWT WebSocket
    User->>View: 打开通知页
    View->>API: GET /api/notifications?scope=
    API->>Service: listMyNotifications(currentUserId, scope)
    Service->>DB: 按 user_id 查询并过滤 scope
    DB-->>View: 当前用户通知

    Service->>DB: INSERT 未读通知
    Service->>Push: pushToUser(ownerId, NOTIFICATION_CREATED)
    Push-->>Client: 通知事件
    Client-->>View: 页面内事件
    View->>View: 去重并置顶显示

    User->>View: 标记已读
    View->>API: POST /api/notifications/{id}/read
    API->>Service: markRead(currentUserId, id)
    Service->>DB: 校验归属后 UPDATE

    Client--xPush: 网络中断
    Service->>DB: 断线期间继续 INSERT
    Client->>Push: 退避重连
    Client-->>View: REALTIME_RECONNECTED
    View->>API: GET /api/notifications
    API-->>View: 补回遗漏通知
